  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Coastal protection of the island of Kaback</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project relates to the coastal protection of Kaback. The farming region Ile de Kaback is home to Guineas most important food supply region. It is seriously threatened by the sea. The salinization of agricultural land, the threat to the population from the sea and the failure of previous interventions underline the urgency and the need for interventions. Under the D2B different studies will be undertaken to find the most suitable solution for this region.</narrative>
  </description>
